// Industries, the stage runtime (docs/specs/phase7/industries.md 3, 5.1; P7-IN1): three chains and their 17 stage kinds with the three tiers each. Crew bands rise with the tier and never overlap (the user's Q4 decision, section 14);
// rates are kg of the main good a worker-day at skill 50, capacity is the stations' and machines' own limit a day (0: the crews alone), store_kg what the stage's own store holds, support_pm the carriers a mine needs per 1,000 hewers.
// The plans, pieces and recognition of each tier are IN2's (the plan and recognise fields stay empty here).
